  "definition": "Distribution Utility",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-09-14",
  "historyNote": "#9515, eff 7-18-09; ss by #9998, eff 9-20-11 (from Puc 902.05); ss by #10502, INTERIM, eff 1-3-14, EXPIRED: 7-2-14 (from Puc 902.07) New. #10757, eff 1-8-15; ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20 (formerly Puc 902.05)",
